WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.280
 Thank you everybody. I personally from the bottom of my heart would like to

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:10.000
 thank everyone

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:18.120
 here for your presence this evening among other inductees. Unlike Jose said,

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.000
 God is first

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.720
 on my list of thanks and then comes my parents and he mentioned my parents

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.000
 which were very

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.870
 mental in my life. Pretty van grossa Maria, who are now these kids, may they

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:33.000
 rest in peace.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:39.590
 Who taught me everything from early childhood that service to others is the

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:41.000
 most important

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:50.570
 thing to do in our lifetime. Our homeless will of faith and love, joy and care

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:51.000
 and compassion

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:58.150
 for others. We have families passing through the city that needed a place to

00:00:58.150 --> 00:00:59.000
 stay and our

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:05.220
 home became that place. It was a house full of most of the time among with our

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:07.000
 pets. It

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:13.220
 was like a suit. I would like to thank all the people that helped me through my

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:14.000
 illness

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:23.250
 which Jose mentioned. From a traumatic brain injury on May 21st will be 10

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:26.000
 years in 2008.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:33.480
 An angry reason that almost took my life. I want to thank my siblings present

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:35.000
 here for

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:42.130
 your undaunted love and support during that time and to this day I love you and

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:43.000
 gracias

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:58.000
 and I would like my siblings to stand wherever you are. My brothers and sisters.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:03.870
 Gracias for being here. I want to thank all my dedicated friends that I have

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:05.000
 had all these

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:12.470
 years. Too many to count. I want to thank my sisters and community that their

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:13.000
 many

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:17.190
 consistence and associties of peace for your continued support in all the

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:19.000
 ministries I

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:26.000
 took on. Thank you. There are some sisters with me here tonight. Please stay.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:36.000
 [applause]

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:40.760
 Lastly I would like to thank Deborah Henson and the Cleveland International

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.000
 Hall of Fame

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:48.500
 and Dan for all you did to give me here and you continue to do for others that

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:49.000
 will come

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:56.000
 after us. May you all have a safe trip back home. May the peace of our gracious

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.000
 God go

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:01.000
 with you.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:07.000
 [applause]

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:12.000
 I got Sister Alicia, I got an email from her saying, you know, I'm expecting to

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.000
 see Sister

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:19.300
 Rachel and all that here, you know, and she sent me an email saying, I got my

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:20.000
 outfit,

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:26.000
 I've got a flower for my hair, I've got a clumsy skirt, so if I'm dancing, it'll

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:26.000
 move

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.000
 with me.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:29.000
 [laughter]

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:32.000
 [applause]

